BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:3101 Kennedy Road
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T200000
UID:1012@haveyoursay.toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Project: City Planning & Development Review Community Consulta
 tion Meetings\n\nThe City of Toronto’s Development Review Division has r
 eceived applications for an Official Plan Amendment and a Zoning By-law Am
 endment at 3101 Kennedy Road to redesignate the easterly portion of the su
 bject lands from Core Employment Areas to General Employment Areas\, and t
 o rezone the eastern half of the lands to permit a broad range of retail a
 nd service commercial uses. The applications would introduce a Site and Ar
 ea Specific Policy (SASP) applicable to the subject site. The SASP would p
 ermit retail and service commercial uses across the entirety of the subjec
 t land. The SASP would also prohibit major retail developments of 6\,000 s
 quare metres or more of gross floor area. Join us at the virtual community
  consultation meeting where you can view presentations\, provide comments\
 , ask questions\, and speak with the project team.\n\nRegistration: https:
 //events.teams.microsoft.com/event/8df590fa-be7f-484b-909f-f1b2ff948e41@f0
 bc8ec6-9ed8-4d0c-9189-411ad949cc65
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://haveyoursay.toronto.ca/city-planning-development-review-commun
 ity-consultations/3101-kennedy-road
X-SOURCE:City Planning Consultations
END:VEVENT
