BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:North York at the Centre Public Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T200000
UID:1007@haveyoursay.toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Project: Planning Study Community Consultation Meetings\n\nOn 
 March 26\, 2026\, City Council endorsed the Recommended Option for managin
 g growth and change in North York Centre over the next 30 years. As part o
 f its decision\, Council directed staff to consider changes to the propose
 d parks network\, and proposed land uses and building types along Empress 
 Avenue\, Willowdale Avenue and in two blocks located northeast of Yonge St
 reet and Finch Avenue (PH28.6 Recommendation 13). Visit toronto.ca/nycentr
 e to learn more. Meeting materials will be posted when available.\n\nType:
  In person
LOCATION:100 Princess Ave\, North York\, Toronto\, ON M2N 3R7\, Canada
URL:https://haveyoursay.toronto.ca/development-review-city-planning-planni
 ng-study-events/north-york-centre-public-meeting
X-SOURCE:City Planning Consultations
END:VEVENT
